{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"leather_folded","model_identifier":"leather_folded","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## leather_folded\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -5.4..5.5, y -3.0..1.5, z -8.4..-0.7 (size 10.9 x 4.5 x 7.7 u = 31 x 13 x 22 cm).\nFolded leather: three smooth, brown tanned hides folded flat and stacked (~30 x 20 cm), each with a darker fold line and edge; cleaner and browner than the furry raw hide. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## leather_folded\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -5.4..5.5, y -3.0..1.5, z -8.4..-0.7 (size 10.9 x 4.5 x 7.7 u = 31 x 13 x 22 cm).\nFolded leather: three smooth, brown tanned hides folded flat and stacked (~30 x 20 cm), each with a darker fold line and edge; cleaner and browner than the furry raw hide. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"fold_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,-3.0,-8.0],"to":[5.0,-1.5,-1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,14,26.0,15.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,20,27.0,21.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,18,10.0,19.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,22,7.0,23.5],"texture":0},"up":{"u